    same grid size; for each scale s in {1,2,4,...,S}:
      stamp motif scaled by s (each pixel becomes s x s block)
      place at col = 2*(s-1), top row = r0 - s + 1
    stamps tile rightward; each grows vertically away from the seam between motif rows
    all non-stamp cells are background

generation_strategy:
